    "description": "If you're a passionate Senior Doctor with drive and ambition, Ipca Laboratories Ventures Solutions in Agra is the place for you. We're growing fast and need talented people to grow with us.\n\nAbout Ipca Laboratories Ventures Solutions:\nIpca Laboratories Ventures Solutions is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Collaborate with pharmaceutical representatives and medical suppliers\n• Educate patients and families on health management and disease prevention\n• Conduct routine health assessments and screenings\n• Maintain sterile environments and follow infection control protocols\n• Adhere to NABH/JCI accreditation standards\n• Monitor patient progress and adjust treatment plans accordingly\n• Administer medications and treatments as prescribed\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Chartered Accountant (ICAI)\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Infection Control\n• Proficiency in Surgical Procedures\n• Proficiency in BLS/ACLS\n• Proficiency in Telemedicine\n• Proficiency in HIPAA Compliance\n• Proficiency in Medical Coding\n• Proficiency in Medical Ethics\n• Proficiency in Diagnostic Skills\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Learning & development budget\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Agra, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Ipca Laboratories Ventures Solutions!",
